# Evolution by item (decomp party menu PARTY_MENU_EXIT_CODE_EVOLVE_BY_ITEM): the bag's Water Stone opens
# the party with ABLE! / UNABLE! (decomp PartyMenu_PrintMemberComment_CanUseEvoItem); Piplup refuses it ("It
# won't have any effect."), Eevee takes it: the stone is used up and Eevee evolves into Vaporeon (B cannot
# stop a stone's evolution, even under `evolve cancel`), then the bag comes back.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_EEVEE 10
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 10
give item platinum:ITEM_WATER_STONE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_201 115 853 right
until idle
+0 evolve cancel
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:1
+1 assert app bag
+1 tap pocket:0
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap menu:0
+1 assert app party
+0 screenshot stone-party
+1 tap slot:1
+1 press a
+1 release a
+1 assert app bag
+0 assert state bag.items [{"item":"platinum:ITEM_WATER_STONE","count":1}]
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap menu:0
+1 tap slot:0
+1 assert app evolution
+0 assert state bag.items []
until app bag 3000
+0 assert state party[0].species "platinum:SPECIES_VAPOREON"
+0 assert state party[1].species "platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP"
+1 tap cancel
until app start-menu
+1 press b
+1 release b
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
